    <worksheet name='Low-Revenue by Gender Distribution (above $500,000) (2)'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontsize='9'>Low-Revenue by Gender Distribution (below $500,000)</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The three below $500,000:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Bike Stands </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Cleaners </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Socks</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key finding</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>There is </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>very little difference</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> in gender distribution.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>High-revenue products:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Male 50.8% vs Female 49.2%</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Low-revenue products:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Male 51.5% vs Female 48.5%</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Therefore:</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>High-revenue subcategories do not show a meaningful gender difference compared with low-revenue subcategories.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The customer base is relatively balanced between males and females.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Strategic implication</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The company should </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>not make major product or marketing decisions based solely on gender</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Instead, customer age, country, product category and purchasing behavior appear more useful for segmentation.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
