    <worksheet name='Profit Margin by Sub-Cat.'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontsize='9'>Profit Margin by Sub-Category</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key finding</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>There is a substantial difference in profitability between sub-categories.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Socks</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> have the highest margin at approximately </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>66.60%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>But the biggest business concern is not necessarily the lowest-margin product — it is the combination of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>low margin + high revenue</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>For example:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Road Bikes</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Revenue: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>$37.22M</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Margin: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>37.84%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Road Bikes generate enormous revenue, so even a small improvement in margin could have a significant impact on total profit.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Jerseys</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Revenue: </run>
