        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>INSIGHT</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Revenue generally increased substantially over the period.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>The strongest full year is </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>2015</run>
            <run fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>, generating approximately </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>$22.32M</run>
            <run fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>From 2011 to 2015, revenue more than doubled:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>$10.05M → $22.32M</run>
