    <dashboard name='Story 5' type='storyboard'>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-description'>
          <format attr='font-style' id='story-description_9' value='normal' />
          <format attr='font-weight' id='story-description_9' value='normal' />
          <format attr='text-decoration' id='story-description_9' value='none' />
          <format attr='font-style' id='story-description_10' value='normal' />
          <format attr='font-weight' id='story-description_10' value='normal' />
          <format attr='text-decoration' id='story-description_10' value='none' />
          <format attr='font-style' id='story-description_11' value='normal' />
          <format attr='font-weight' id='story-description_11' value='normal' />
          <format attr='text-decoration' id='story-description_11' value='none' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='964' maxwidth='1016' minheight='964' minwidth='1016' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98340' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type='layout-flow' w='98426' x='787' y='830'>
            <zone h='10477' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type='flipboard-nav' w='98426' x='787' y='830' />
            <zone h='87863' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type='flipboard' w='98426' x='787' y='11307'>
              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point captured-sheet='' id='1' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='70332' id='6' story-point-id='1' type='text' w='48720' x='2362' y='20747'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>1. Protect the core 17–49 customer segment</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>This group contributes roughly </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>67% of revenue</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Focus campaigns around:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Cycling </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Fitness </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Lifestyle </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Commuting </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Recreational riding </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>2. Increase Accessories cross-selling</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Accessories have a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>62.57% category profit margin</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>, significantly above Bikes and Clothing.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>For example:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>- Bike purchase → Helmet + Gloves + Bottle + Bike Rack</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>This could increase revenue while maintaining strong margins.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>3. Investigate low-margin subcategories</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Pay particular attention to:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Caps — 22.22% </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Jerseys — 23.15% </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Road Bikes — 37.84% </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Touring Bikes — 37.84% </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Pricing, supplier costs and promotional strategies should be reviewed.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='70436' id='7' story-point-id='1' type='text' w='45374' x='51575' y='20747'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>4. Optimize Road Bike profitability</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Road Bikes generate approximately </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>$37.22M</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>, making them the largest individual sub-category by revenue.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Because of that huge revenue base, even a small improvement in margin can produce substantial additional profit.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>5. Strengthen lower-performing markets</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>The US and Australia are performing strongly, while Canada has the lowest revenue among the six countries.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Investigate:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Product preferences </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Pricing </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Marketing effectiveness </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Distribution </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- Customer demographics </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>6. Don&apos;t over-segment by gender</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>The gender distribution is almost evenly balanced.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Therefore, marketing should focus more on </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>age, country, product preference and purchasing behavior</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> than on gender alone.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='4253' id='8' story-point-id='1' type='text' w='34843' x='33366' y='15560'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontsize='15'>RECOMMENDATIONS</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{A9194838-D1B9-4E91-B9EB-9B7D99361796}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
